        "title": "Developmental Stages of Social Emotional Development in Children - StatPearls - NCBI Bookshelf",
        "url": "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK534819/",
        "description": "During the brief periods of alertness ... The first measurable social milestone is around 1 to 2 months of age: <strong>infants begin to smile socially in response to parental high-pitched vocalizations or smiles</strong>....",
